158
00:05:18,637 --> 00:05:21,327
Data centers came here years ago.

159
00:05:21,417 --> 00:05:23,287
But Nia hears a warning.

160
00:05:23,417 --> 00:05:25,245
When the reservoirs ran low,

161
00:05:25,245 --> 00:05:28,023
Iceland's big power company had to sell

162
00:05:28,023 --> 00:05:29,317
