163
00:05:29,347 --> 00:05:31,886
Cheap doesn't mean endless.

164
00:05:32,150 --> 00:05:33,067
Third pin,

165
00:05:33,067 --> 00:05:34,300
Quebec.

166
00:05:34,410 --> 00:05:36,400
Nia checks the price.

167
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:36,960
Here,

168
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:39,041
a giant factory pays less than a

169
00:05:39,041 --> 00:05:41,355
quarter of what the same factory would

170
00:05:41,355 --> 00:05:42,880
