171
00:05:42,950 --> 00:05:44,837
Cubby is thrilled.

172
00:05:45,083 --> 00:05:46,633
Then the catch.

173
00:05:46,633 --> 00:05:49,225
Hydro-Québec now says its days of surplus

174
00:05:49,225 --> 00:05:51,003
