185
00:06:08,983 --> 00:06:09,628
Fourth pin,

186
00:06:09,628 --> 00:06:10,513
Texas.

187
00:06:10,513 --> 00:06:12,488
Cheap natural gas,

188
00:06:12,488 --> 00:06:14,797
huge wind and solar farms,

189
00:06:14,797 --> 00:06:17,809
and a grid famous for plugging new

190
00:06:17,809 --> 00:06:20,083
customers in fast.

191
00:06:20,283 --> 00:06:21,470
In Abilene,

192
00:06:21,470 --> 00:06:23,650
the first giant Stargate halls switched on

193
00:06:23,650 --> 00:06:25,703
in twenty twenty-five.

194
00:06:25,953 --> 00:06:27,515
Now everyone wants in,

195
00:06:27,515 --> 00:06:30,005
so many that the grid operator is

196
00:06:30,005 --> 00:06:31,589
