198
00:06:34,653 --> 00:06:36,983
What all this means for household bills

199
00:06:36,983 --> 00:06:39,055
is the story of Why AI Could

200
00:06:39,055 --> 00:06:42,244
Make Your Electricity Bill Explode.

201
00:06:42,483 --> 00:06:43,637
Fifth pin,

202
00:06:43,637 --> 00:06:45,033
the Gulf.

203
00:06:45,123 --> 00:06:47,555
Sunshine nearly every day,

204
00:06:47,555 --> 00:06:48,347
cheap gas,

205
00:06:48,347 --> 00:06:50,313
and money to spend.

206
00:06:50,523 --> 00:06:53,039
Saudi Arabia signed solar contracts at

207
00:06:53,039 --> 00:06:55,325
about a penny per kilowatt hour,

208
00:06:55,325 --> 00:06:57,393
