223
00:07:30,550 --> 00:07:31,728
Sixth pin,

224
00:07:31,728 --> 00:07:33,140
Brazil.

225
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:36,858
Its electricity is mostly renewable,

226
00:07:36,858 --> 00:07:37,820
from rivers,

227
00:07:37,820 --> 00:07:38,782
