231
00:07:44,460 --> 00:07:46,140
But Nia finds a catch on the

232
00:07:46,140 --> 00:07:46,980
bill.

233
00:07:47,100 --> 00:07:49,011
Nearly half of what Brazil's power

234
00:07:49,011 --> 00:07:51,135
