257
00:08:34,627 --> 00:08:36,097
The IEA found that in parts of

258
00:08:36,097 --> 00:08:36,706
Europe,

259
00:08:36,706 --> 00:08:38,597
a data center can wait as long

260
00:08:38,597 --> 00:08:41,297
