269
00:08:58,327 --> 00:08:59,413
in the country,

270
00:08:59,413 --> 00:09:01,187
more than all the homes in its

271
00:09:01,187 --> 00:09:02,230
cities.

272
00:09:02,280 --> 00:09:03,502
Around Dublin,

273
00:09:03,502 --> 00:09:05,247
the grid got so tight that new

274
00:09:05,247 --> 00:09:07,491
data centers now have to bring their

